<title>USA: GOLF-SCORES AT LPGA TOUR CHAMPIONSHIP AFTER FIRST ROUND.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SCORES AT LPGA TOUR CHAMPIONSHIP AFTER FIRST ROUND.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores at the</p>
<p>$700,000 LPGA Tour Championship after the first round Thursday</p>
<p>on the par-72, 6,924-yard Desert Inn Golf Course (golfers U.S.</p>
<p>unless stated):</p>
<p>67 Mayumi Hirase (Japan)</p>
<p>68 Michelle McGann, Penny Hammel, Jane Geddes, Juli Inkster</p>
<p>69 Val Skinner, Laura Davies (Britain), Karrie Webb</p>
<p>(Australia), Emilee Klein</p>
<p>70 Liselotte Neumann (Sweden), Meg Mallon, Kelly Robbins</p>
